Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:35:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] gfxstream: forward ray tracing pipelines

Velox-local change (biblioklept). VK_KHR_ray_tracing_pipeline and
VK_KHR_pipeline_library are generated for the guest, ray tracing pipelines
create guest pipeline objects, and the entrypoint keeps deferred operations
in the guest (VK_OPERATION_NOT_DEFERRED_KHR). The extension is listed under
debug.velox.ray_tracing=1 when the host lists it.

